 "notes": "02-475959-20 International Nice Price issue.\n\nThe inner sleeve has a straight opening\nLabels look slightly different compared to the pressing of [r=11821333]:\n- On label B, the track-listing is completely below the spindle hole,\n- No dot after \"INC\" in rim text.\n\n\"NY State Of Mind\" produced for Works Of Mart Productions. Recorded and mixed at D&D Recording, NYC.\nContains a sample of \"Mind Rain\" as performed and written by [url=http://www.discogs.com/artist/Joe+Chambers]J. Chambers[/url].\nGifted Pearl/Ill Will Music, Inc./Skematics Music (ASCAP)\n\n\"Life's A Bitch\" recorded and mixed at Unique Studios and Chung King Studios, NYC.\nContains a sample of \"Yearning For Your Love\" as performed by [url=http://www.discogs.com/artist/Gap+Band%2C+The]The Gap Band[/url] and written by R. Wilson and O. Scott. Used courtesy Polygram Special Products, Inc.\nIll Will Music, Inc./Skematics Music/Minder Music (USA) (ASCAP)/Taking Care Of Business Music/Total Experience Music Publishing Co. (BMI)\n\n\"The World is Yours\" produced for Mecca And The Soul Brother Productions, Inc. Recorded and mixed at Battery Studios, NYC.\nT La Rock courtesy of Warlock Records. Published by Hit'n'Hold Music (ASCAP)\nIll Will Music, Inc./Skematics Music/Pete Rock Publishing (ASCAP)\n\n\"Halftime\" produced for Paul Sea Productions, Inc. Recorded and mixed at Chung King Studios, NYC.\nContains samples of \"Dead End\", \"Soul Travelin'\" and \"School Boy Crush\".\nLarge Professor Music Ltd./EMI April Music, Inc./Ill Will Music, Inc./Skematics Music/Minder Music (USA) (ASCAP)\n\n\"Memory Lane (Sittin' In Da Park)\" produced for Works Of Mart Productions. Recorded and mixed at D&D Recording, NYC.\nContains sample of \"We're In Love\" as performed by [url=http://www.discogs.com/artist/Reuben+Wilson]Reuben Wilson[/url] and written by R Wilson and P. Barsella.\nEMI Unart Catalog Inc./Ill Will Music, Inc./Skematics Music/Gifted Pearl (ASCAP)\n\n\"One Love\" produced for A Tribe Called Quest, Inc. Recorded and mixed at Battery Studios, NYC.\nContains sample from \"Smilin' Billy Suite Pt. II\" as performed by [url=http://www.discogs.com/artist/Heath+Brothers%2C+The]The Heath Brothers[/url] and written by J. Heath.\nIll Will Music, Inc/Skematics Music (ASCAP)/MJQ Music, Inc.(BMI)\n\n\"One Time For Your Mind\" produced for Paul Sea Productions, Inc. Recorded and mixed at Chung King Studios, NYC.\nContains sample of \"Walter L\" as written by [url=http://www.discogs.com/artist/Gary+Burton]G. Burton[/url]. \nLarge Professor Music Ltd./EMI April Music Inc./Ill Will Music, Inc./Skematics Music (ASCAP)\n\n\"Represent\" produced for Works Of Mart Productions. Recorded and mixed at D&D Recording, NYC.\nIll Will Music, Inc./Skematics Music/DJ Premier Publishing/Gifted Pearl (ASCAP)\n\n\"It Ain't Hard To Tell\" produced for Paul Sea Productions, Inc. Initial Tracking at PowerPlay Studios, Long Island City, NYC. Recorded and mixed at Chung King Studios, NYC.\nContains samples of \"Human Nature\" as performed by [url=http://www.discogs.com/artist/Michael+Jackson]Michael Jackson[/url] and written by J. Betties and J. Pocaro; and \"N.T.\" as performed by [url=http://www.discogs.com/artist/Kool+%26+The+Gang]Kool & The Gang[/url] and written by G. Redd, Sr., G. Redd, Jr., R. Handy, C. Horne, R. Bell, R. Bell, R. Mickens, D. Thomas, G. Brown and C. Smith.\nLarge Professor Music Ltd./EMI April Music Inc./Ill Will Music, Inc./Skematics Music (ASCAP)\n\n℗ & © 1994 Sony Music Entertainment, Inc.\nMade in Holland\n\nDistribution Sony Music\n\nCatalog numbers:\n475959 1 on spine and labels.\nCOL 475959 1 above barcode on back cover.\n02-475959-20 in lower left corner on back cover.\n\nAll runouts are machine-stamped on both sides of the record except for the A which is hand-etched.\n",
